          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "einstellen is built from ein \"in\" and stellen \"to put, to place\", inherited from Old High German stellen and Proto-Germanic stallijaną (EtymDB): you put someone into a job."
            }
          ]
        },
