          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "beschäftigen comes from Middle High German scheftec \"busy, active\" (EtymDB), of the family of schaffen \"to make, to create\": you give people work to do."
            }
